{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55296","headline":"北海题渚宫 · 窦俨","name":"北海题渚宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"纪南南望水城宽，水色天光混一般。\n大抵江乡足诗景，咏吟如把画图看。\n（见《舆地纪胜》卷六五《江陵府》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦俨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55296.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55296","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}